PS: If you are using nn to read your news, you can create a file
.nn/init to control the behaviour of nn. Have it contain a few lines as
follows:

sequence
rec.games.roguelike.nethack,rec.games.hack
<other groups here>
!!

This will make sure that you get to see ONLY the groups that are
between the sequence and !!, no other groups. Also, groups on the same
line separated by a comma will be merged into ONE group when being
shown.
